<BaseLayout title="About" description="Adam Cui is an operating leader focused on organic growth, turnaround and platform building." locale="en" path="/en/about">
  <main>
    <section class="about-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>A diverse career.<br />One operating thread.</h1><p>More than twenty years across ownership models, industries and markets—always focused on moving complex businesses toward sustainable growth.</p></section>
    <section class="about-facts shell" aria-label="Career summary">
      <article><strong>02</strong><p><span class="about-fact-title">Leading PE Funds</span><span class="about-fact-detail">Portfolio Company CEO</span></p></article>
      <article><strong>02</strong><p><span class="about-fact-title">Multinationals</span><span class="about-fact-detail">China CEO</span></p></article>
      <article><strong>04</strong><p><span class="about-fact-title">SOE · Private · MNC · Consulting</span><span class="about-fact-detail">Career backgrounds</span></p></article>
      <article><strong>02</strong><p><span class="about-fact-title">China and the US</span><span class="about-fact-detail">Work experience</span></p></article>
    </section>
    <section class="about-story shell"><div class="section-heading"><p>01</p><h2>Career</h2></div><div class="about-narrative"><p class="about-lead">World-class strategy and multinational management discipline, matched by frontline experience winning in China through deeply localized approaches.</p><p>Experience spans state-owned, private and multinational enterprises, including two CEO roles in portfolio companies backed by leading private equity funds and two China CEO roles in multinational corporations. Work in both China and the United States brings together global systems and local operating realities.</p><p>Across technology, industrial and B2B services, the recurring work has been organic growth, turnaround, M&amp;A integration and organizational modernization—translating strategy into revenue, margin, cash and capability.</p></div></section>
    <section class="about-capabilities shell" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title-en"><div class="section-heading"><p>02</p><h2 id="capabilities-title-en">Core Experience</h2></div><div class="capability-list">{capabilities.map((item) => <article><span>{item.index}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.body}</p></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="about-philosophy shell"><p>“Growth is not a target number.<br />It is a capability an organization can repeat.”</p><div><span>Operating philosophy</span><p>Real operating improvement changes both the results and the system that produces them.</p></div></section>
  </main>
